  "design": {
    "idea": "ACT III — THE BLIND EYE: Hollow Wick blinds Lens and Prism; track the Silvered Owl by shadow/Beam, slide Ice Block 1 to chalk-bridge the first chasm, record an Echo Rose ghost (12s via Cue-Mirror!) holding the baffle plate so Ice Block 2 slides into the east socket, and unlock the Fly-Loft.",
